              "name": "Scope Note Text",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Backed by the existing model only: slots, alias / email / org, active + switchable + disabled flags, 5h / 7d / per-model usage and resets, optional spend, last-good freshness and errors, auto policy and switch history. No trends, plan labels, forecasts or billing history are drawn anywhere in this design.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
